## Import Order
1. React and React-related imports
2. Third-party libraries (MUI, Redux, etc.)
3. Internal imports (absolute paths)
4. Relative imports (only when no absolute alias applies)

```javascript
// ✅ Correct import order
import React, { useState, useEffect } from 'react'
import { Button, TextField } from '@mui/material'
import { useDispatch, useSelector } from 'react-redux'
import { useLoginMutation } from 'store/api/auth.apislice'
import { useAuthSession } from 'hooks/useAuthSession'
import { LoginContainer } from 'features/containers/auth/LoginContainer'
```
